tor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-02-27T02:04:03Z","updated_at":"2025-11-28T11:39:03Z","closed_at":"2025-11-28T11:38:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 4.3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable (77dcf97d8) - Windows 10.0.19045 - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6070) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-11260H @ 2.60GHz (12 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn a 2D scene, set a subviewport to be the root's world_2d will cause the editor to be displayed in the scene.\n\n`@tool`\n`extends SubViewport`\n`func _ready() -> void:`\n`\tworld_2d = get_tree().get_root().world_2d`\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5b0055d8-adbe-414d-b9ca-98b13c2f3016)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8fff1a7f-608d-4ec1-8983-5570fb97e6c4)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a 2D scene\nAdd SubviewportContainer and SubViewPort Node\nAdd following scripts to SubviewPort\n```\n@tool\nextends SubViewport\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tworld_2d = get_tree().get_root().world_2d\n```\nReopen the scene\nAnd the editor will display itself in it.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19000504/Bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","av